WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.013
Brad: I think the shrink-gun went off.

2
00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:19.920
Danny: Something definitely happened!

3
00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:22.474
Brad: I wonder if it shrunk something.

4
00:00:22.475 --> 00:00:30.897
Danny: Let's look.

5
00:00:30.898 --> 00:00:36.324
Danny: Look! It worked!

6
00:00:36.325 --> 00:00:38.788
Brad: I think you're right.

7
00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:40.463
Danny: Of course, I'm right.

8
00:00:40.464 --> 00:00:44.076
Now, let's go get those bullies!

9
00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.432
Brad: No, wait!

10
00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:48.480
Danny: What's the matter now, Brad?

11
00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.777
Brad: I think we should test it more.

12
00:00:50.778 --> 00:00:54.622
Danny: Why? The nano-putty worked. Let's go.

13
00:00:54.623 --> 00:01:00.285
Brad: In any science experiment, you need to test things more than once.

14
00:01:00.286 --> 00:01:06.045
Danny: Ugh! I didn't realize I was still in school. Sorry, Teacher.

15
00:01:06.046 --> 00:01:08.246
Brad: We should make sure it's safe.

16
00:01:08.247 --> 00:01:10.045
Danny: Fine.

17
00:01:10.046 --> 00:01:14.058
Brad: Let's try it on that glass of water.

18
00:01:14.059 --> 00:01:15.544
Danny: Let me do it.

19
00:01:15.545 --> 00:01:18.906
I'm the one who will use it on Chuck and Dave.

20
00:01:18.907 --> 00:01:25.519
Brad: Fine, go ahead.

21
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:29.220
Danny: See? It's perfect. It's teeny-tiny.

22
00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:30.937
Can we go now?

23
00:01:30.938 --> 00:01:34.605
Brad: No, there's one more thing.

24
00:01:34.606 --> 00:01:36.466
Danny: Now what?!

25
00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:40.816
Brad: We have to make sure we can return things to their normal size.

26
00:01:40.817 --> 00:01:42.975
Danny: Why does that matter?

27
00:01:42.976 --> 00:01:48.228
Brad: We don't want to shrink the bullies forever.

28
00:01:48.229 --> 00:01:52.921
Brad: Danny! You don't want to shrink them forever, do you?

29
00:01:52.922 --> 00:01:56.220
Danny: Why not? It would teach them a lesson.

30
00:01:56.221 --> 00:01:59.189
Brad: I thought we just wanted to scare them.

31
00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:03.980
Danny: Being tiny forever would scare them!

32
00:02:03.981 --> 00:02:08.363
Brad: Danny, I won't shrink them if we can't restore [n3@them to their normal size.

33
00:02:08.364 --> 00:02:11.058
Danny: Maybe I'll just do it without you.

34
00:02:11.059 --> 00:02:13.617
Brad: It's my dad's nano-putty.

35
00:02:13.618 --> 00:02:16.247
I won't let you use it without me.

36
00:02:16.248 --> 00:02:18.536
Danny: All right!

37
00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:21.394
Brad: It should be a simple adjustment.

38
00:02:21.395 --> 00:02:24.602
Brad: I just need to reverse the stream . . .

39
00:02:24.603 --> 00:02:26.468
This should work.

40
00:02:26.469 --> 00:02:33.266
Danny: Well, give it a try.

41
00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:35.148
Danny: Perfect!

42
00:02:35.149 --> 00:02:37.944
Brad: Actually, I don't think it is.

43
00:02:37.945 --> 00:02:40.108
Danny: What do you mean?

44
00:02:40.109 --> 00:02:43.012
Brad: I think it's a bit bigger than it was before.

45
00:02:43.013 --> 00:02:47.023
Danny: Brad! We can't just keep testing it!

46
00:02:47.024 --> 00:02:51.226
Brad: But I don't think the reversal process is perfect.

47
00:02:51.227 --> 00:02:54.555
Danny: You think the glass is a bit bigger, right?

48
00:02:54.556 --> 00:02:55.805
Brad: Yes.

49
00:02:55.806 --> 00:02:58.935
Danny: But you don't know for sure?

50
00:02:58.936 --> 00:03:02.602
Brad: No.

51
00:03:02.603 --> 00:03:05.118
Danny: Well, I know one thing for sure.

52
00:03:05.119 --> 00:03:08.628
Danny: I won't be happy until I get those bullies.

53
00:03:08.629 --> 00:03:10.380
Danny: And now we can.

54
00:03:10.381 --> 00:03:14.228
It's time to go.
